WEBVTT

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.100
Since the audition for the commercial was canceled...

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.600
...she had a long break before returning to work.

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:04.560
But...

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.400
...there was a rumor about <i>Full Moon</i>  going around at the television station...

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.070
On top of that...

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.110
...at some point, someone tore apart her costume...

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.150
...and we were in a huge bind! {Oh Nippon and your dai pinchii}

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.490
But even in such a bind...

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.200
...Mitsuki came up with an idea to overcome it...

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.080
...and the television program finished without a hitch.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.160
Really...

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.990
...this girl's become so strong!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:23.500
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.090
Do you understand?

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:29.730
Yes.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.650
My first solo live concert?!

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.950
You think it might be a little too early, huh?

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:10.230
There's been a huge response from the fans!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.010
That means that...

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:13.640
...they'll all want to go to the live concert!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.820
Are they for real?

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.150
It's like a dream come true...

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.690
Getting to hear you say such adorable things...

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:22.150
There won't be much time for that now...

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:24.320
Things are going to be hectic from here on out.

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.320
You'll lose all of your summer vacation...

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:27.360
...so be ready!

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.120
Okay!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.580
Well, regarding that...

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.040
For your first live concert...

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.080
...is there anything special you'd like to try out?

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:33.830
Eh?

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.540
Are you asking... me?

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.820
Yes.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:40.250
Just how does <i>Full Moon</i>  feel about this right now...?

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.280
My feelings right now?

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:47.100
Isn't there something?

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.050
An image... or a keyword...

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:50.220
Anything's okay, so...

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.370
...just tell us.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.560
Maybe that's asking for too much, huh?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:55.480
Nope.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.280
I'll do it!

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.990
Let me do it!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:08.040
Huh?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:08.950
W-What is this?

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:13.620
Today...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:17.130
...I'll be going over the essential parts of a live concert...

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.420
...and explaining the–

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:20.630
Huh?

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.820
Give it up.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.900
Man!

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.900
I give up on this!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.600
Anyways...

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.260
...to have a good live concert...

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:31.430
...things like your image...

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:33.510
...and theme are important!

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:34.510
Ah... in that case...

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.140
Because...

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:36.220
...when it comes to time to prepare...

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.560
...things will get ugly if you have to worry about stuff like that.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.190
That's why...

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.730
...Meroko's going to help you this time.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.230
Like I said, that's just...

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:44.190
I'm already...

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.400
...far too brilliant...

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:49.050
It's like I'm the number one bride for any Shinigami.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:50.240
That's way out there...

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:51.920
I understand...

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.540
Everyone else thinks so...

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.080
Um...

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:55.080
Meroko?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.660
Listen to people when they're talking!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.710
Mitsuki already knows all of that.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:03:59.580
Huh?

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:00.670
She does?

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:01.670
Well...

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.670
Then... what are you planning on doing...

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.170
...for <i>Full Moon</i> 's first live concert?

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.220
Yep.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.880
It's Moon and Stars.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.800
Moon and Stars?

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:10.420
Yep!

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:12.350
The theme of <i>Full Moon</i> 's first live concert...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.430
...Moon and Stars, has been decided.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.350
Decided?!

00:04:15.670 --> 00:04:16.850
Takuto!

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:20.070
You never told me that it was already decided!

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:23.840
I've been trying to tell you the whole time, but you haven't been listening!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.280
I'm heartbroken...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.640
Thanks for being so concerned about everything, Meroko.

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.660
Actually, you see...

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:38.620
This live concert...

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.790
...is being broadcast to everyone around the world through the Internet. {TEH INTARWEBZ}

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:30.720
Be sure to watch, Eichi-kun!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:31.560
I-I can't... I... I-I can't... I can't breathe!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.110
I-I can't... I... I-I can't... I can't breathe!

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:33.440
I-I can't... I... I-I can't... I can't breathe!

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:34.840
I-I can't... I... I-I can't... I can't breathe!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.560
For the location of <i>Full Moon</i> 's first live concert...

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.280
...we've decided on Bayside Hall.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.270
We'll open at five...

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:45.440
It'll start at six, so make sure everyone knows.

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:46.320
Yes.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.860
As for the visual effects and stage lighting...

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.690
...they were finished yesterday.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.310
What about the musicians?

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:54.830
We already got the best of the best!

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.120
The backup chorus is perfect as well!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.110
I see.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:59.790
Have all the dancers been gathered?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:00.500
Yep!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.660
We've got experienced foreign dancers ready to go!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:04.770
All right.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.870
Isn't this perfect?

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.500
Damn good job...

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.480
Yep.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.300
Boss!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.260
They're done printing!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.510
Oh ho...

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.680
Wow!

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.830
Nice!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.000
They're great!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.440
Wow! It's so beautiful!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.770
Yeah, it looks good.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:24.610
All right.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:28.190
With this, Moon and Stars... will be on its way!

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.560
Let's do our best!

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.230
Okay!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.280
Yep!

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:41.280
This is my first live concert...

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:42.950
Moon and Stars!

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:44.120
So then...

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.550
...everything's still in the process of being set up, right?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.170
Yep!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.540
I'm sure it'll be a great live concert!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.960
Everyone, please come and listen, okay?

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.500
Good luck!

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.420
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.180
Sure.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.370
Leave it to me.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:02.480
I'll come up with the perfect advertisement.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.100
We're counting on you!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.890
To tell the truth...

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:08.630
...my own kids are huge fans, <i>Full Moon</i>.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:11.040
I'll be there with my kids to listen.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.150
Good luck.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:12.900
Okay!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.190
Here you go.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:18.720
Akiba-san, I definitely want you to come listen!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:21.360
This is the greatest!

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:24.180
Such a great seat at your first live concert...

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.620
...I'm so moved!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.300
Put these posters everywhere 
around the store, 'kay?

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:34.470
Okay, okay.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.740
Yes, ma'am.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.510
<i>Full Moon</i>-oneechan!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.590
I'm cheering for you, so...

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.470
...you have to have a cool live concert!

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:42.680
Got it!

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:43.760
You can count on me.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:44.780
I'll do my best!

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.910
Takuto's going to cheer along with me!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:47.430
All right!

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.140
Promise!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.650
'kay. It's a promise!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.280
Yeah!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:56.740
Thanks for your hard work!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.410
Oh, good luck on your live concert!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.570
We're rooting for you!

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:00.590
Okay!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:01.950
Huh?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.700
Komaki-san...

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.440
Thank you very much!

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.350
Everybody!

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:32.250
Come hear me at my first live concert, 'kay?

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:43.050
This is where the live concert will be held.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.000
Wow...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.170
Wow...

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.600
It's huge!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.130
This is just the beginning.

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.600
You'll sing on much bigger stages.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.930
If you're scared by just this, it'll be problematic.

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.200
Um...

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:06.430
Can I try standing on it?

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:07.970
Of course.

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.430
This is your stage.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:39.570
Ah!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:10:00.230
I'm gonna give it my all!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.040
I-I'm home...

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:11.840
Ah.

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:13.370
Geez!

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.040
Aren't you late?

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.580
Sorry...

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:16.960
Ah?

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.850
Oh my, already?

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.630
At least change your clothes first.

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:23.380
That's right.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:25.130
You have to take proper care of your skin.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:28.520
Hey, kid!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.530
Wake up!

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.280
Yes sir!

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.600
First solo live concert...

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:38.020
Moon and Stars...

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.870
Please come listen...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.490
My, my, my... she's sound asleep.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.570
Man, guess it can't be helped.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:57.230
Do your best!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.520
Good night.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:15.980
Come in!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.140
Are you done?

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:18.940
Yep!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:24.900
How is it?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.200
Hmm...

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.820
It's good, but...

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.230
...it seems to lack that <i>oomph.</i>

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.370
That's right...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:31.950
It feels like something's missing.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.670
Shall we throw on some accessories, then? {shani: accessories? like really? :D}

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:35.330
In addition...

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.870
...let's try some makeup and add a little color.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.080
Eh?

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:40.740
Eh? Eh? {alpha}

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:41.380
Eh? Eh? {alpha}

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.350
How's this?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.500
Well...

00:12:02.440 --> 00:12:04.900
In that case, I'll go even farther!

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.320
Ah... ah... ah-choo!

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:08.110
Ah... ah... ah-choo!

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:08.780
Ah... ah... ah-choo!

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:11.110
Ah! I'm sorry!

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:12.480
I'll get that off right away!

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.660
Let's see...

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:15.390
Did I forget to bring it?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.300
This is...

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:20.510
Ah!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:24.890
What are you doing, Mitsuki?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.500
<i>Full Moon</i>-chan?

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:28.300
Huh?

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:28.300
Huh? {separate}

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.670
I'm done!

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:30.390
Eh?

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:34.760
It's Moon and Stars!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.220
Yep. It's cute.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.350
All right.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:39.480
That's taken care of.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.000
Let's do her costume fitting now.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.320
It's so wonderful!

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.720
I just tried to add something extra.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.580
Thank you, Machi-san!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.740
So now, then..

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.580
...all that's left is the accessories...

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:58.540
That's right.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.100
Then... the theme is...

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.310
All right!

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.290
In that case, let's make this a masterpiece!

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:06.290
Okay!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:22.290
Let's see... next comes... this one.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:24.900
Ah.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.320
Or is this one better...?

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.200
Don't fall asleep!

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.360
But I wanna go to sleep already!

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.180
You're the one who wanted to help.

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:38.670
Far too brilliant...

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.830
The best choice for a bride, right?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.740
It's done!

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:29.540
It's finished?

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:30.780
Nope.

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:33.190
I'll try this color next.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:37.410
This is taking a lot longer than I expected.

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.160
Good.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.310
This will work.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.110
Everyone will fall in love with 
that accessory instantly!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:47.650
Yep!

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.770
T-There's a problem!

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:51.070
Eh?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.190
What's wrong?

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:52.860
Well...

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:54.740
...the site's been canceled!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:55.770
What?!

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.540
What do you mean?!

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.700
The live concert's tomorrow!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:02.580
Someone called saying that they were a member of the Village Pro staff...

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.660
...and told them that tomorrow's live concert for <i>Full Moon</i>  has been put on hold.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:07.710
No way!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.840
That's complete nonsense!

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.170
Someone go tell them about this... fix it before it's too late!

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.490
Well...

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:16.090
...another event was scheduled immediately after...

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.900
All the posters and tickets are already out!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:22.940
Anyways, divide everyone and get on the phones!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:23.650
It doesn't matter where!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:24.980
Just find an open place!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:25.870
Okay!   Okay!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.300
Yes... tomorrow.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.270
I understand.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.610
Have a nice day.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.400
Is that so?

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.070
There's no way?

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:33.950
It's the day after today!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.020
How can we find a place that fast?

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:37.510
Um...

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.420
What's going to happen?

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.280
Well...

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.100
If we can't find a place...

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.740
...we'll have to postpone the live concert.

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:45.770
Eh?!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:50.690
That can't be...

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.080
I can't believe this!

00:16:18.400 --> 00:16:20.240
Can you help us out somehow?

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.100
Even if you say that...

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.560
I beg you!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.540
Anyways, can you come back later?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.790
We're already booked.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:27.600
Have a nice day.

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:39.570
I'm begging you!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.410
An e-mail.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:03.610
I wonder who it's from.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:11.140
I'm looking forward to <i>Full Moon</i> 's 
first live concert...

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.370
Ah!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.630
It's those high school students from before!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.500
But...

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.900
I'm sorry...

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:24.120
I won't be able to do... the live concert...

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:41.070
<i>Eh...</i>

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.980
<i>It's too bad that it's been postponed!</i>

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.990
<i>The place doesn't really matter...</i>

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:47.160
<i>We just wanted to listen to you sing.</i>

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:47.890
Eh?

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.900
<i>It's Moon and Stars!</i>

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:54.000
<i>Under a real starry sky...</i>

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.880
<i>...it'd be kind of fashionable, right?</i>

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:57.880
Moon and Stars...

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:11.580
Underneath a real starry sky...

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:16.040
That's right.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.210
I can sing anywhere!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.000
Set up the lights over there.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:33.760
Make it snappy!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:34.490
Okay!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:37.200
If we don't hurry, we won't make it before the live concert starts!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:37.540
Okay!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:38.750
Everyone!

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:41.250
The location for <i>Full Moon</i> 's concert has changed!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.800
This way!

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:50.130
Is this the place?

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.010
In a place like this...?

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.890
Where's <i>Full Moon</i> ?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.150
Okay.

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:03.020
Start it off.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:03.570
Okay.

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:06.120
Sorry to keep everyone waiting!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.820
On this, the last evening of the summer...

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.540
...let's all have one last blast!

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:13.330
<i>Full Moon </i>'s first live concert!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.160
Moon and Stars...

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.520
...is beginning!

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.340
Ah! It's <i>Full Moon</i> !

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.480
Wow! It's so pretty!

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.060
It looks just like the real moon and stars in the sky.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.330
Ah... you just used your power again...

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.200
Thank you.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.010
I'm going to do my best!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.430
Oh well.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.240
Everyone!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:36.080
Thank you for coming for my live concert today!

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.730
Please enjoy it to the end!

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:14.300
Isn't it romantic?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.850
It's the best she's ever been.

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:07.020
Hey, Meroko!

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:09.640
I heard the manager moved in to a place near her house!

00:23:09.640 --> 00:23:12.490
What?! Is that gonna be all right?!

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:16.320
What's wrong? She said it was to better support her at her job.{She said it's to support her activities better.}

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:17.140
But...

00:23:17.140 --> 00:23:20.910
We have to keep the fact that Mitsuki is 
<i>Full Moon</i>  a secret from her family! {}

00:23:21.490 --> 00:23:25.570
See, I knew it! That housekeeper Tanaka-san found out!

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:27.700
Oh crap...

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:29.920
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:31.520
Moving Panic
